## Changes Summary

### Phase 1: Filter
- Added Filter 6 (Leverage Type) — ARBITRAGE(10) > BROKER(9) > INTELLIGENCE(8) > AGGREGATOR(7) > MEDIA(5) > WRAPPER(3) > BUILDER(1)
- Score < 5 = KILL (kills BUILDER + WRAPPER)
- Reweighted formula: leverage(0.25) + competition(0.20) + protection(0.20) + ai_resistance(0.15) + access(0.10) + margin(0.10)

### Phase 2: Money Flow Scanner
- New primary scanner (0/6) — maps transaction chains, finds bottleneck positions
- Outputs position types, supply/demand contacts, disintermediation defense

### Phase 3: Scanner Inversions
- All 5 scanners inverted from "find gap → build" to "find money flow → position"
- regulatory: gap → compliance broker/intelligence position
- cross-price: gap → arbitrage/broker position with supply+demand contacts
- cross-language: gap → affiliate/reseller/consultant position via partner programs
- timing: gap → overflow broker/aggregator position during surges
- founder-network: enhanced with money flow mapping per contact

### Phase 4: Deal Tracker
- deal-tracker.md: converts opportunities to deal cards (5 supply + 5 demand per opportunity)
- deal-learner.md: extracts patterns from outcomes, feeds back into scanner weights
- deal-dashboard.md: pipeline view with metrics, daily actions, pattern insights

### Phase 5: Integration
